# .spun get of dir001 again, over an older DATA/ONE.BIN, DIRTEST.TXT and
# C:/dot/SPUNDIR. y installs it again; O overwrites ONE.BIN and asks again at
# DIRTEST.TXT; A overwrites it and all the rest with no more questions, so
# .spun ends without another key. mame-dir.sh checks that every file has the
# zip's bytes after the run.
put @SPUN@ /dot/SPUN
put @CAT@ /sys/spun.cat
put @OLD@ /apps/spundir/deep/DATA/ONE.BIN
put @OLD@ /apps/spundir/deep/DIRTEST.TXT
put @OLD@ /dot/SPUNDIR
autostart .spun get dir001
autostart PRINT "SPUNDIRDONE"
autostart FOR i=0 TO 1 STEP 0: NEXT i
seconds 40
noreset 7.5
key 16 y
key 20 o
key 24 a
snap 15 19 23 27 39
screen 39 Installed. Install again?
screen 39 SPUNDIRDONE
